WEBVTT

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.340
I thought I could live with just a little bit of happiness...

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:55.000
Though, with a little despair, I've begun to think I've fallen into depths of darkness.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:00.470
I've already come this far...

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:08.810
Miki-chan?

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.340
I'm back.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.180
Kippei!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.740
Do you know where Yuzuyu-chan and Miki-chan are?

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.840
Nope... They aren't here?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.210
I wonder if they went out to play together...

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.040
To play?

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.650
Probably.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.660
They'll probably be back soon.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.990
Kippei, go wash you hands.

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.870
Hey. Will we get there soon?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.040
Yeah, soon.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.960
Do you think Mama's doing well?

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:40.150
Yeah.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:49.620
They're late.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:56.670
I should've given Miki a curfew!

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.460
I wonder if she's annoyed 'cause I didn't take her to school.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.660
Stop pacing!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:08.030
I figured this would happen from the start...

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.830
But suddenly taking Yuzuyu-chan like isn't fair at all.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.430
Not fair at all...

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.820
We're here, Yuzuyu.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:07.760
Here?

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:17.830
Someone' here?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:18.760
It's Mama!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.040
It's Mama, right?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.550
Miki-chan!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.130
Bring the food.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.750
Kazu! Calm down.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:38.180
Hey.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.660
Stop that, Kazu.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.830
My parents with relatives...

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.120
Miki-chan! Aren't you gonna go in?

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:31.840
Well, well... Even If I didn't go through the trouble of bringing you here, they would have had lots of replacements for me.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:38.230
It's like I didn't even exist from the beginning.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.610
Let's eat.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.960
Not pimento...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.760
Miki?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.470
Miki-chan, wait up!

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:10.900
Was Mama gone?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.120
Miki-chan!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.320
I don't know where your mother is!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.590
That was a lie!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:25.630
You're fine!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:30.910
Even without your mother, you have someone waiting for you!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.150
Yuzuyu...

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:53.150
Sorry.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.520
I'm sorry.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.130
I wanna go home!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:07.730
Yeah...

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:10.600
Sorry.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.900
Hello?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.050
It's Miki!

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.530
Yuzuyu's here, too.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.790
I see. Yuzuyu's with you.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.570
What're you doing?

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:50.940
Are you angry?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.370
Hurry up and come home.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:55.550
Sorry!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.590
Come get Yuzuyu.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.030
Wait Kippei!

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:04.820
Where're you going?

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.980
What happened?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.410
I am gonna go get her!

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.890
Wait! Are you going to be okay on your own?

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.450
I'll be fine. I'll be right back.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.060
If you make a big fuss, it'll become a problem, so stop.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.340
More importantly, give me 1,000 yen, I'll be riding the train.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:22.270
Why don't you have 1,000 yen?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:24.810
See ya.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:41.430
Yuzuyu... He said he'd come get you soon.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:47.570
Miki-chan, did something sad happen to you?

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:05.330
I don't know whether it was sad, or even what it was anymore...

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.750
But for some reason, I don't want to remember anything.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.470
Standing here...

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:18.590
...now makes me realize that even though I used to be happier...

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:52.240
Oh Miki. Your uniform looks good.

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:55.490
Do your best!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.190
Okay!

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.050
Do your best!

00:10:58.440 --> 00:10:58.970
Okay!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:06.710
I truly wanted to go to that school, and even though the tuition was expensive,

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:11.420
they didn't frown, but cheered me on...

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:16.990
That's why I studied hard and made lots of friends.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.800
If I was happy, Dad and Mom would be happy, so...

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:22.960
That's why...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:26.880
What?

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.020
Sensei... and Mori-kun?

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:40.620
Got it? It's your fault for cheating on the exam

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.440
If you don't feel like quitting school, tell your parents that you fell down and got hurt.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:47.240
Okay... I'm sorry.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.210
Oh, Sakashita.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.610
What're you doing? Hurry home.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.430
S-Sensei!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:02.580
What?

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:04.610
I saw what you did right now.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:08.040
Aren't you overdoing it a bit?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.270
Who do you think you are?

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:17.290
After that...

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.910
...he moved my seat, which used to be right in the middle to a lonely corner...

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.850
During attendance, he never called my name...

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.730
...and he had everyone stop talking to me.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.070
If you oppose me, you'll end up like her.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:44.980
What should I do?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:47.370
Are you stupid?

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:48.690
Mori-kun...

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:52.970
Opposing your homeroom teacher, and getting his attention at your new school...

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.420
You're done for.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:56.660
See ya.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:00.680
What's wrong, Miki?

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.070
Hurry up and eat!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.440
U-Umm...

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.370
Miki, is school fun?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:11.610
Yeah.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:12.980
Do your best.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.780
What's everyone gathered here for?

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.250
I wanted to try hurting someone, right?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.230
Try dying.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.200
The fire started in an instant... and my friends became devils.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:33.610
What?!

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:40.580
Now our homeroom teacher may even compliment us.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.570
Just joking.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.410
Hey, Sakashita.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.680
Try dying.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.150
Just joking.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:51.650
I must protect...

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.210
I must protect myself.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.690
Miki... You... What's with... What's with your hair?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:11.380
I heard from your homeroom teacher that your attitude has been bad, too!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:17.050
What? If you have something to say, spit it out!

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.640
I have nothing to say.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.290
Why, you...

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.180
Dear!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:35.430
I'll sleep and go to school properly...

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:40.420
I won't tell him.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.130
I'll never tell them!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:45.130
Even if I did, they wouldn't understand.

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:50.270
And if I told them, they might even cry.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:02.640
There's no place for me at school or at home.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.510
I don't really understand.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.420
It's okay. You don't need to understand.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:20.130
Even though I was able to tell you... I'm sorry.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.610
Yuzuyu... Miki.

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.760
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.500
What were you doing?

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:52.780
A school uniform?

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:00.940
Well, whatever.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.440
Okay, shall we go home?

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:07.000
I'm hungry!

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:13.730
Miki... What're you doing?

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:23.960
Come over here.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.940
Yuzuyu, wait here a minute.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:35.910
Miki.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.640
Don't come any closer!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.490
I'm gonna die...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:45.920
What're you saying, idiot?

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:49.800
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.960
It's not sudden!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:59.150
No one knew, but I've been suffering all along!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.430
Miki-chan!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.410
Don't move! It's dangerous!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.280
I'm lonely...

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:13.260
I'm so lonely that I can't go on living!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:18.120
There's no reason for me to be anywhere...

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:24.220
When no one would look at me anymore, I was truly alone.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:31.800
They had to tell me one by one that I really existed... or else I couldn't go on.

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:37.830
Someone might actually telll me that... but...

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:42.280
My body can't hold on any longer...

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.910
Don't die... please.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.710
For now... don't say that!

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:06.440
You have Yuzuyu and someone else more important than me, right?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.160
At the school infirmary...

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:28.050
The others are different from you.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.410
There's certainly something that I want to tell only you.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.650
I wanted someone to talk to me... with warm words...

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:44.030
Someone who would realize with compassion that I had hurt someone and try to reassure me.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:48.020
Someone like that... who even I am able to meet.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.550
Is that true?

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:54.610
Yeah.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:00.290
Someone like that... who even I am able to meet.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:20.160
You scared me.

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:39.910
Miki, when it seems your parents are going to get angry at you, wear a happy smile!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.940
Their feelings of anger will melt away.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.500
You don't belive me?

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.840
I'm not wrong!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:52.090
It's the best way to keep people from getting angry at you, and I've learned after 17 years of life.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.070
Now, practice!

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:57.540
Smile!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.450
Well, try smiling in your own way.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:06.480
Yuzuyu...

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:10.950
Sorry for everything.

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.110
No. It's okay!

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.320
Let's play again, Miki-chan!

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:17.270
Sure.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.690
What's wrong?

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.320
What have you done?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:34.040
I wanted to die, and tried to commit suicide.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.170
Why, you... Causing me more trouble!

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:42.180
Dear, stop it!

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:46.860
Don't make Miki any angrier!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:52.700
That my own daughter would want to die..

00:20:54.400 --> 00:21:03.310
No. Truly.. I.. Dad.. said that he didn't want me...

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:08.810
Something bad happened at school..

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:14.010
But no matter what happened, no matter what was done to me... I endured it!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:23.560
Even if nobody else believed me, I wanted at least you and Mom to understand.

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:24.800
Miki..

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.660
I'll do my best.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:29.930
I'll be good and go to a new school.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.260
I can do it for sure.

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:34.870
So believe in me.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:37.770
Miki-chan's crying!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.290
It's okay.

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:46.290
It'd be nice if you could live with everyone.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:49.120
Then no one would be lonely.

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:51.210
For sure!

00:23:54.420 --> 00:23:57.030
I imagined it, but it's scary!

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:58.950
One Kippei, per home..

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:01.740
Then I'm special!

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:05.420
You lucky little girl!

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:06.960
I'm hungry!

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.210
Yuzuyu, what' wrong?

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:23.690
That!

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:26.420
There you are, you little black devil!

00:24:27.910 --> 00:24:28.690
Take that!

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:30.550
Don't try creeping around the Katakura household!

00:24:32.050 --> 00:24:32.960
What is it?

00:24:34.360 --> 00:24:37.820
The scary red-haired one made her hair black and came back!?

00:24:38.810 --> 00:24:40.580
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:40.780 --> 00:24:41.950
At the End of Summer.

00:24:43.380 --> 00:24:47.270
I didn't call Kokoro-chan all summer!
